  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Barnfonden Foundation CSO strategy 2025-2027</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Barnfonden Insamlingsstiftelse CSO strategi 2025-2027</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Barnfondens program Unite for Children, Youth and Environment &#xe4;r avsett att st&#xf6;dja &#xe5;tta lokala civilsamh&#xe4;llesorganisationer i fyra l&#xe4;nder: Kenya, Etiopien, Bolivia och Bangladesh. 
Programmets &#xf6;vergripande m&#xe5;l &#xe4;r att Barn och ungdomar f&#xf6;rverkligar sina r&#xe4;ttigheter genom &#xf6;kad kunskap och st&#xe4;rkt motst&#xe5;ndskraft, vilket s&#xe4;kerst&#xe4;ller deras v&#xe4;lbefinnande, skydd, deltagande och lika tillg&#xe5;ng till en h&#xe4;lsosam och h&#xe5;llbar milj&#xf6;.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Barnfonden&#x2019;s program Unite for Children, Youth and Environment is designed to support eight local civil society organizations in four countries: Kenya, Ethiopia, Bolivia and Bangladesh. The program&#x2019;s overarching goal is for children and young people to realize their rights through increased knowledge and strengthened resilience, ensuring their well-being, protection, participation, and equal access to a healthy and sustainable environment.</narrative>
  </description>
